WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:06.465
AND AS USUAL
I DON’T EVEN KNOW HIS NAME.

00:00:06.465 --> 00:00:08.842
I’M TRYING TO GET DRESSED
QUICKLY AND GET OUT OF THERE

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:09.885
BEFORE HE WAKES UP,

00:00:09.885 --> 00:00:15.098
BUT I CAN’T FIND MY UNDERWEAR.

00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:19.853
I LOOK EVERYWHERE,
BUT I JUST CAN’T FIND THEM,

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:22.522
AND THEN IT HITS ME.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:27.319
I HAD LEFT THEM AT ANOTHER GUY’S
APARTMENT EARLIER THAT NIGHT,

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:30.989
AND THAT’S WHEN I KNEW
I HAD A PROBLEM.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.664
- THANKS FOR SHARING, SCOTTY.

00:00:38.664 --> 00:00:42.459
WELL, I NOTICE A LOT
OF NEW FACES THIS EVENING,

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:44.670
AND I’M SO GLAD YOU ALL CAME,

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:49.299
AND I WANT YOU TO KNOW THAT
THIS IS A SAFE PLACE TO SHARE.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:51.760
SO IF YOU WANT TO TELL US
YOUR STORY,

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:55.180
THERE’LL BE NO JUDGMENT.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:58.934
- SURE, I’LL GO.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.352
HI, Y’ALL.

00:01:00.352 --> 00:01:02.437
NAME’S WENDELL,

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:08.151
AND I AM IN FACT
A SEXUAL ADDICT.

00:01:08.151 --> 00:01:10.279
all: HI, WENDELL.

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:13.073
- AND WHAT BRINGS YOU HERE,
WENDELL?

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:16.285
- WELL, YOU KNOW, MY LIFE,

00:01:16.285 --> 00:01:19.997
SEXUALLY SPEAKING, IS CRAZY,

00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:21.957
AND I JUST WANT TO FIND

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:27.212
ONE SINGLE SOLITARY PERSON

00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:28.505
TO SPEND THE REST
OF MY LIFE WITH.

00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:31.550
JUST ONE, JUST ONE.

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:34.177
- SO DO YOU FEEL LIKE
YOUR ADDICTION IS

00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:35.554
TOO MUCH TO HANDLE RIGHT NOW?

00:01:35.554 --> 00:01:37.180
- DUH.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:40.392
I MEAN, IT’S BEEN CRAZY, Y’ALL.

00:01:40.392 --> 00:01:43.895
WITH ME, THE NASTIER
THE BETTER.

00:01:43.895 --> 00:01:45.897
I’M A DIRTY DOG.

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:49.901
TRY EVERYTHING, ALL THE FIXINGS.

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:53.447
TANTRIC, MUCH LIKE STING.

00:01:53.447 --> 00:01:54.823
ALL THE BELLS AND WHISTLES.

00:01:54.823 --> 00:01:58.744
YOU NAME IT, I’VE DONST IT.

00:01:58.744 --> 00:02:02.539
- AND WHEN WOULD YOU SAY
YOU HIT ROCK BOTTOM, WENDELL?

00:02:02.539 --> 00:02:04.541
- WHEN IT GOT SLIPPERY
OUTSIDE MY SHOWER,

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:06.668
ON THE FLOOR
OUTSIDE MY SHOWER.

00:02:06.668 --> 00:02:09.046
OH.

00:02:09.046 --> 00:02:14.426
I HIT ROCK BOTTOM SEXUALLY--

00:02:14.426 --> 00:02:16.636
OH, IT WAS PROBABLY LAST NIGHT,
LAST NIGHT.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:19.097
- DO YOU THINK THAT YOU COULD
TELL US WHAT HAPPENED, WENDELL?

00:02:19.097 --> 00:02:21.475
- YEAH, LET’S SEE.

00:02:21.475 --> 00:02:23.518
IT WAS JUST LIKE
ANY OTHER NIGHT.

00:02:23.518 --> 00:02:25.437
I HAD ORDERED A LARGE PIE,

00:02:25.437 --> 00:02:28.398
PEPPERONI,
PINEAPPLE, CHEESY CRUST,

00:02:28.398 --> 00:02:33.070
SOME CHEESY BREAD ON THE SIDE.

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:37.074
CUT TO 30 "MIN" LATER,

00:02:37.074 --> 00:02:42.871
PIZZA PARLOR SENT OVER A
DELICIOUS LADY DELIVERY PERSON.

00:02:42.871 --> 00:02:46.666
BODY TEN, FACE TEN.

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:49.336
THAT’S MY WEAKNESS.

00:02:49.336 --> 00:02:52.923
SO I INVITED HER INSIDE,
OPENED UP THE BOX.

00:02:52.923 --> 00:02:56.426
IT WAS HOT.

00:02:56.426 --> 00:03:00.597
DEVOURED THE FIRST SLICE
LICKETY-SPLIT, CRUST FIRST.

00:03:00.597 --> 00:03:03.558
SECOND SLICE
DIDN’T STAND A CHANCE.

00:03:03.558 --> 00:03:05.227
ATE THE TIP OF THAT BITCH FIRST,

00:03:05.227 --> 00:03:09.106
WASHED IT DOWN WITH A POP.

00:03:09.106 --> 00:03:11.274
THEN I GOT NASTY
WITH THE CHEESY BREAD.

00:03:11.274 --> 00:03:14.945
MY HEART STARTED POUNDING HARDER
THAN USUAL, KER-SLUNK,

00:03:14.945 --> 00:03:16.655
KER-SLUNK.

00:03:16.655 --> 00:03:18.407
MOVED ON TO THE THIRD SLICE--
- WHAT--

00:03:18.407 --> 00:03:19.991
WHAT--WHAT ABOUT THE GIRL?

00:03:19.991 --> 00:03:21.576
- WHAT GIRL?
OH, THE GIRL.

00:03:21.576 --> 00:03:24.871
YEAH, SHE WAS THERE TOO.

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:30.168
I INVITED HER INTO MY BOUDOIR,
AKA "THE STABBIN’ CABIN."

00:03:30.168 --> 00:03:31.711
WE DISROBED ONE ANOTHER.

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:33.713
I TOUCHED HER ON HER GENITALIA.

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:39.428
SHE TOUCHED ME ON MY MAN-ITALIA,
AND THAT’S WHEN I HIT IT.

00:03:39.428 --> 00:03:42.681
SEXUALLY, OF COURSE,

00:03:42.681 --> 00:03:45.600
UPSTAIRS, DOWNSTAIRS,
ALL AROUND THE TOWN STAIRS,

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.686
AS YOU DO,

00:03:47.686 --> 00:03:52.607
AND BY THEN
IT WAS JUST ANOTHER NIGHT,

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:57.028
AND I MEAN OIL EVERYWHERE,
AND...

00:03:57.028 --> 00:03:59.823
SAUCE ALL OVER ME.

00:03:59.823 --> 00:04:02.701
- S-SAUCE?

00:04:02.701 --> 00:04:06.413
- OH, YEAH,
THAT’S MY WORD FOR...

00:04:06.413 --> 00:04:09.124
EJACULATE.

00:04:09.124 --> 00:04:13.920
ANYHOO, I’M SO DISTRAUGHT
BECAUSE I FEEL VULNERABLE,

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.338
AND I DON’T KNOW.

00:04:15.338 --> 00:04:19.759
I JUST FEEL LIKE ANYONE

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:21.428
COULD TAKE ADVANTAGE
OF ME RIGHT NOW,

00:04:21.428 --> 00:04:25.432
A-NY-ONE.

00:04:25.432 --> 00:04:28.226
’KAY, LET’S SEE WHAT THE BLONDES
HAVE TO SAY FIRST.

00:04:28.226 --> 00:04:30.145
- WELL, THANK YOU, WENDELL.

00:04:30.145 --> 00:04:32.856
THANK YOU FOR SHARING.
IT’S ACTUALLY OUR TIME TODAY.

